{'symbol': 'KMI', 'date': '2022-07-01 08:05:00', 'title': 'TENNESSEE GAS PIPELINE RECEIVES FERC APPROVAL FOR PRODUCER CERTIFIED GAS POOLING SERVICE PROPOSAL', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TENNESSEE GAS PIPELINE COMPANY, L.L.C. (TGP), A SUBSIDIARY OF KINDER MORGAN, INC. (NYSE: KMI) TODAY RECEIVED APPROVAL FOR ITS PRODUCER CERTIFIED GAS (PCG), OR RESPONSIBLY SOURCED GAS (RSG), AGGREGATION POOLING SERVICE FROM THE FEDERAL ENERGY REGULATORY COMMISSION (FERC). THE PCG AGGREGATION POOLING SERVICE IS NOW AVAILABLE AT ALL POOLING POINTS ACROSS THE TGP SYSTEM. PCG IS CONVENTIONAL NATURAL GAS SOURCED FROM PRODUCTION FACILITIES THAT HAVE BEEN CERTIFIED BY A QUALIF'}